    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Read-only REST API providing access to Gitcoin bounties and grants data. Supports filtering by experience level, project length, bounty type, owner address, open status, and GitHub URL. Returns JSON-formatted data including funding amounts, contributor addresses, token types, and project metadata.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Gitcoin Support",
